NOTE ON APPLYING A SOFTWARE LICENSE TO DATA
-------------------------------------------
Apache-2.0 is a software license. DEM applies it to the dataset as the
default license because it is permissive, includes an express patent grant,
and is widely understood by downstream model builders. It is applied only to
records the contributor has the right to license. Third-party content embedded
in outputs is excluded by the redaction/review pipeline. Contributors who
prefer a data-specific license may tag their records ODC-By-1.0 or CC-BY-4.0.
See README.md and the generated dataset card for the full licensing note.
